packages: .

-- Regex support (SARA.Security.RegexGuard, SARA.Routing.Engine) is
-- provided by "regex-tdfa", a pure-Haskell automaton-based regex
-- engine -- no C library of any kind, so no system libpcre/libpcre2,
-- no pkg-config entry, and no distro-specific package name to chase,
-- ever. This project previously depended on regex-pcre (system
-- libpcre/PCRE1, which current Debian no longer packages at all) and
-- briefly on pcre2 (bundled PCRE2 C sources, still a backtracking
-- engine); see BUILD_AND_FIXES_SUMMARY.md for the full history and
-- why regex-tdfa is where this settled. This file is intentionally
-- just "packages: ." now; no flag overrides or repository
-- restrictions are needed for a normal `cabal build`.
